                                                "sense_id": "359ba6e1-abab-3914-9404-bb5d27d1508e",
                                                "text": "None was any more sensational than No.6, a fantastic 27-23 last-gasp win over the Arizona Cardinals, cemented by a brilliant toe-sticking TD catch by Santonio Holmes in the back of the end zone with 35 seconds remaining on a pass lasered by quarterback Ben Roethlisberger."
